   583	 *   initialization thread.  That is because the initialization thread
   584	 *   cannot wait for event.  Waiting may be required, for example, to
   585	 *   mount a file system or or initialize a device such as an SD card.
   586	 *   For this reason, such driver initialize must be deferred to
   587	 *   board_late_initialize().
